@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title 3.72 — Liên kết logic giữa service
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Identity / users" as I
rectangle "Course / courses, lessons, enrollments" as C
rectangle "Assignment / quizzes, problems, attempts, submissions" as A
rectangle "Blog / posts, comments, votes" as B
rectangle "Chatbot / chat_sessions, chat_messages" as H
I ..> C : userId / instructorId / studentId
I ..> A : userId / createdBy
I ..> B : authorId / userId
I ..> H : user_id
C ..> A : courseId / lessonId
C ..> H : context qua API
A ..> H : context qua API
legend bottom
Tất cả đường ở hình này là liên kết nghiệp vụ/API,
không phải FK MySQL xuyên database, không ngụ ý cascade xóa.
endlegend
@enduml